left map T as a Mealy transducer (state (L_(j-1), L_(j-2)); input/output):
  state (0, 0): in 0 -> out 0, next (0, 0), in 1 -> out 1, next (1, 0)
  state (0, 1): in 0 -> out 1, next (0, 0), in 1 -> out 0, next (1, 0)
  state (1, 0): in 0 -> out 1, next (0, 1), in 1 -> out 1, next (1, 1)   (not invertible: both inputs give the same output)
  state (1, 1): in 0 -> out 0, next (0, 1), in 1 -> out 0, next (1, 1)   (not invertible: both inputs give the same output)
